        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>When attempting to make an arrest, <strong>constables</strong> take advantage of numbers, making ranged Revolver attacks to give their fellow constables an opening to close the distance. Once they close in, they use their Dogpile feature to help them Grapple their targets. When they have a target under control, constables then use Escort to drag the target back behind police lines, working to keep each suspect separated so they can’t help each other escape.</p>",
        "role": "minion"
    },
